@startuml
title Compile-time project dependencies

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam ArrowColor #374151
skinparam component {
  BorderColor #374151
  FontColor #111827
}

component "TradingRisk.Api\nASP.NET Core adapter\nand composition root" as Api #DBEAFE
component "TradingRisk.Application\nUse cases and ports" as Application #DCFCE7
component "TradingRisk.Infrastructure\nTechnical adapters" as Infrastructure #FEF3C7
component "TradingRisk.Domain\nBusiness model and risk math" as Domain #FCE7F3
component "TradingRisk.Tests\nExecutable specifications" as Tests #EDE9FE

Api --> Application : ProjectReference
Api --> Infrastructure : ProjectReference
Api --> Domain : ProjectReference
Application --> Domain : ProjectReference
Infrastructure --> Application : implements ports
Infrastructure --> Domain : stores domain objects

Tests ..> Api : HTTP integration tests
Tests ..> Application : handler tests
Tests ..> Infrastructure : in-memory adapter
Tests ..> Domain : unit tests

note bottom of Domain
  Domain has no project or NuGet dependencies.
  Arrows point toward code known at compile time.
end note
@enduml
